// Signing settings, kept out of the committed project file.
//
// This file is versioned and intentionally empty: an unset DEVELOPMENT_TEAM lets
// a fresh clone open and build for the simulator without touching anything.
// To sign for a device, create `Signing.local.xcconfig` next to this file (it is
// gitignored) with your own team:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// Same convention as the `.xcode.env` / `.xcode.env.local` pair above.
//
// Applied at the *project* level, because CocoaPods owns the per-target
// baseConfigurationReference slots — so `pod install` never overwrites this.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

// `#include?` is the optional form: no error when the file is absent.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
